WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:13.991
Tina: That was fun!

2
00:00:13.992 --> 00:00:18.915
Danny: Those evil guys may have run off, but they might come back.

3
00:00:18.916 --> 00:00:22.010
Brad: It’s time to make the ocean blue again.

4
00:00:22.011 --> 00:00:27.038
Brad: Okay, Danny, get out the magic clay.

5
00:00:27.039 --> 00:00:29.039
Danny: Oh no!

6
00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.642
Tina: What’s wrong?

7
00:00:30.643 --> 00:00:37.875
Danny: I don’t know which is the magic clay and which is the regular clay.

8
00:00:37.876 --> 00:00:40.637
Tina: Maybe you should test them.

9
00:00:40.638 --> 00:00:43.889
Danny: We can’t afford to waste the magic clay.

10
00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:47.985
Brad: And we don’t have much time, either.

11
00:00:47.986 --> 00:00:49.461
Bello: Blue.

12
00:00:49.462 --> 00:01:00.396
Danny: Why didn’t I notice that before? Thanks, Bello.

13
00:01:00.397 --> 00:01:02.348
Tina: Is it working?

14
00:01:02.349 --> 00:01:05.043
Brad: Not very well.

15
00:01:05.044 --> 00:01:07.837
Danny: Why didn’t it all turn blue?

16
00:01:07.838 --> 00:01:15.628
Tina: Try again!

17
00:01:15.629 --> 00:01:19.445
Danny: Stupid clay, start working!

18
00:01:19.446 --> 00:01:21.196
Tina: Danny, no.

19
00:01:21.197 --> 00:01:23.707
Brad: That’s your last piece.

20
00:01:23.708 --> 00:01:28.651
Danny: It’s got to work this time!

21
00:01:28.652 --> 00:01:32.331
Danny: Why isn’t this working?!

22
00:01:32.332 --> 00:01:35.493
Tina: We have to get the blue to spread somehow.

23
00:01:35.494 --> 00:01:37.935
Brad: But how?

24
00:01:37.936 --> 00:01:44.295
Tina: Wait! I’ve got an idea.

25
00:01:44.296 --> 00:01:46.079
Brad: What are you doing?

26
00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:49.575
Tina: I just have to find the right-sized rock.

27
00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:53.066
Brad: I get it! Great idea, Tina!

28
00:01:53.067 --> 00:01:55.057
Danny: What’s the idea?

29
00:01:55.058 --> 00:01:58.474
Brad: What happens when you throw a rock into a pond?

30
00:01:58.475 --> 00:02:00.295
Danny: I don’t know.

31
00:02:00.296 --> 00:02:03.805
Brad: It causes ripples.

32
00:02:03.806 --> 00:02:08.427
Brad: Look! Those evil creatures are coming back!

33
00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:11.593
Danny: And they’ve brought friends with them!

34
00:02:11.594 --> 00:02:13.189
Brad: Hurry up!

35
00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:15.403
Tina: I’m trying.

36
00:02:15.404 --> 00:02:16.875
Danny: I don’t get it.

37
00:02:16.876 --> 00:02:19.220
She’s going to throw a rock?

38
00:02:19.221 --> 00:02:24.921
Brad: Yes. If it lands in a blue circle, the color will [n3@spread through the whole ocean.

39
00:02:24.922 --> 00:02:26.608
Brad: The ripples will do it.

40
00:02:26.609 --> 00:02:29.803
Danny: Make it a big rock!

41
00:02:29.804 --> 00:02:31.764
Tina: Found it!

42
00:02:31.765 --> 00:02:34.008
Danny: Can you throw it that far?

43
00:02:34.009 --> 00:02:42.269
Tina: Just watch me!

44
00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:44.186
Brad: It’s looking good . . .

45
00:02:44.187 --> 00:02:47.553
Danny: Great throw, Tina!

46
00:02:47.554 --> 00:02:51.653
Brad: Looking good . . .

47
00:02:51.654 --> 00:02:54.381
Brad: Bull’s-eye!
